From c87fba57dd0cbd5d0c066f7dd24aa798f16438ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:20:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(site): show the CamCraft logo above the title on the
 first page

The front page shows the 256 px square icon, centered above the title.
The corners are rounded with border-radius in site/static/style.css.
The icon is a copy of assets/logo/icons/camcraft-256.png in site/static/.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Fixes #2045
